The complete hardware‑software stack is illustrated in Figure 1. The joint‑assignment map for a 30‑DOF humanoid is:

Joint group Actuation strategy DOF
Fingers PCMSA primary (coil arrays) 10
Wrist flex/ext, ankle inv/ev PCMSA primary 4
