I.3 Policy Adaptation Update

The policy maintains a logistic model  \hat{P}_i = \sigma(\theta^T \phi_i) . On receiving a teaching signal with violation v_i, the update is

\theta \leftarrow \theta - \eta \bigl( \hat{P}_i - v_i \bigr) \phi_i,

with learning rate \eta = 0.01 / \sqrt{t}. The feature vector \phi_i encodes distance to constraint boundary, historical violation rate, and current trust level.

